msgstr "Greamaigh Téacs _Gan Formáidiú i gCónaí"

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:33
msgid ""
"Older items are always plain text. Shift+Enter pastes plain text any time."
msgstr ""
"Is gnáth-théacs iad míreanna níos sine i gcónaí. Greamaíonn Shift+Enter "
"gnáth-théacs am ar bith."

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:39
msgid "Also Remember Selected _Text"
msgstr "Coinnigh _Téacs Roghnaithe i gCuimhne Freisin"

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:40
msgid "Text selected with the mouse, which the middle button pastes"
msgstr "Téacs a roghnaítear leis an luch, a ghreamaíonn an cnaipe láir"

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:48
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "Stóráil"

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:49
msgid ""
"The history is kept in memory only and is gone after logging out. Pinned "
"items stay when the history is cleared and do not count toward the limit. "
"Content that applications mark as secret, such as from password managers, is "
"not remembered; not every password can be recognized."
msgstr ""
"Ní choinnítear an stair ach sa chuimhne agus imíonn sí tar éis logáil amach. "
"Fanann míreanna pionnáilte nuair a ghlantar an stair agus ní áirítear i "
"dtreo na teorann iad. Ní choinnítear i gcuimhne ábhar a mharcálann "
"feidhmchláir mar rúnda, mar shampla ó bhainisteoirí pasfhocal; ní féidir "
"gach pasfhocal a aithint."

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:52
msgid "_Items Remembered"
msgstr "_Míreanna i gCuimhne"

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:66
msgid "_Keep After Logging Out"
msgstr "_Coinnigh Tar Éis Logáil Amach"

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:71
msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "Faic"

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:72
msgid "Pinned Items"
msgstr "Míreanna Pionnáilte"

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:73
msgid "Whole History"
msgstr "An Stair ar Fad"

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:81
msgid "P_ause Remembering"
msgstr "_Cuir an Cuimhneamh ar Sos"

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:82
msgid "New items are not added until this is turned off"
msgstr "Ní chuirtear míreanna nua leis go dtí go múchtar é seo"

